OL,3,ABurnham about to address Labour
OL,4,Aconference as minister says pension
OL,5,Atriple lock should be 'looked at'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Welsh Secretary Stephen Kinnock
OL,8,Fsays with public finances in a "very
OL,9,Fvery difficult position", the
OL,10,Fgovernment has "got to look at the role
OL,11,Fof the state pension in that"
OL,13,FWhile Housing Secretary Angela Rayner
OL,14,Fhas suggested that pensioners may be
OL,15,Fhappy to lose the triple lock, if
OL,16,Fsavings were spent on social care
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
